ion and waste generated  by human beings he claimed he was  created as an incarnation of nature's  wrath and was tasked to wipe out  humanity and thus effectively vaccinate  the earth against future infections  vaccine man was a creature of great  strength and size enough so to be  classed as a threat level of dragon he  breezed through 31 heroes some of which  were a-class he was also said to be  perhaps the greatest mysterious being  that appeared till that point in time  vaccine man was capable of transforming  into a more advanced form bearing longer  claws teeth a darker coloration solid  luminescent red eyes tusks and visible  scales and spikes he could also mutate  only specific parts of his body to  preserve energy number 16 heavy smoker  heavy smoker was a large monster with  several vent pipes on his torso clawed  hands three eyes and a few strands of  hair on his head he held a tobacco pipe  in each of his hands it had six cigars  in his mouth he was able to nearly kill  tank top master an s-class hero had it  not been for flashy flash's intervention  number 17. gyorogyuro guroguro was the  meat puppet of psychos he existed as an  independent entity that allowed psychos  to manage the monster association  without revealing her identity he was  the direct military advisor to orochi  and was strong enough that the monster  king had faith in his abilities prior to  discovering tatsumaki's true power  gyorgyoro believed that he was more  powerful than her whom he had considered  one of the only four heroes capable of  defeating elder centipede guroguro was  capable of moving objects with his mind  such as the rubble that fell in garo  when the hero hunter landed in his  chambers along with stopping his  movements completely however georgiour  could not multitask very well which is  one of his major weaknesses and a flaw  that can be exploited number 18 phoenix  man phoenix man is a very strong monster  and a member of the monster association  he held a middle